tier: 1
face: query
expect: error
note: An unwhitelisted pseudo breaks TOKENIZING, not just matching. :is is not in the hardcoded
note: list, so the identifier run stops at the colon, which is then emitted as a bare COLON and
note: yields "h1":"is(.a)" inside an object. Parse error, message contains "JSON", so 400.
note: Contrast selector-unknown-pseudo-is-500, where a whitelist PREFIX match lets it tokenize.
